==Description==
'''Content Creator Skins''' is a skin series based on Tower Defense Simulator content creators. This skin series is unique, as it does not actually have any obtainable crate in which it is obtained from. Instead, skins will only appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

The cost of the skin depends on their rarity. {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|3,000}} while {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}. There is also unused cost for {{Color|Common}} and {{Color|Uncommon}} skins, that being {{Coins|3,000}}. There is one exception to these, that being the {{Color|ContentCreator|Jordan}} [[Brawler]] skin, as it costs {{Coins|3,232}}.

