==Trivia==
*'''Content Creator Skins''' are all based on Tower Defense Simulator content creators.
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Isaac}} skin is based on [https://www.roblox.com/users/63238912/profile CEOofIsaac].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Wikia}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@WikiaColors WikiaColors].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Elite}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@EliteElite Elite].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Eggrypted}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@eggrypted Eggrypted].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Propellars}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/c/propellars propellars].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Corso}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@CORSOBLOX CORSO].
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Sweaking}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@ItzSweaking ItzSweaking]. 
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Dank}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@DanksPlatter DanksPlatter].
***This skin was made as a reward for being one of the first people to triumph [[Infernal Abyss]] on [[Legacy Hardcore Mode]] mode, alongside [https://www.youtube.com/@CrazRex CrazRex] and [https://www.youtube.com/@5ouIs 5ouls]. All of them received a skin.
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|CrazRex}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@CrazRex CrazRex].
***This skin was made as a reward for being one of the first people to triumph [[Infernal Abyss]] on [[Legacy Hardcore Mode]] mode, alongside [https://www.youtube.com/@DanksPlatter DanksPlatter] and [https://www.youtube.com/@5ouIs 5ouls]. All of them received a skin.
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|5ouls}} skin is based on 5ouls.
***This skin was made as a reward for being one of the first people to triumph [[Infernal Abyss]] on [[Legacy Hardcore Mode]], alongside [https://www.youtube.com/@CrazRex CrazRex] and [https://www.youtube.com/@DanksPlatter DanksPlatter]. All of them received a skin.
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|MegaBit}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@megabit016 Megabit], formerly known as Megalodon.
**The {{Color|ContentCreator|Jordan}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@JordanStayt Jordan Stayt].
*There exist other skins based on content creators or other notable Roblox users, though they were obtainable through codes. These skins are the {{Color|Other|John}} [[Militant]], {{Color|Other|IcyTea}} [[Freezer]] and {{Color|Premium|Kasodus}} [[Cowboy]].
**The {{Color|Premium|Kasodus}} [[Cowboy]] skin was at first a code skin, though it was later moved to the [[Premium Crate]].


